        "username": "arenson9",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/{size}/1900_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-06-04T02:29:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;ketigid&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"ketigid\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>30 seconds?</p>\n<p>I know I can explain the game flow in 15 seconds, but how do you ‘play a bunch’ in the other 15?</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Well … a ‘bunch’ is relative and it was probably more than 15 seconds, but it was along the lines of: Villains play cards, like this one, and it does damage like this and then a hero plays a card like this one, which does this thing, and then use a power and do this other thing, then draw a card, then the environment gets to play a card, like this!</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:06:24.743Z",
