        "created_at": "2012-06-04T19:01:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was one of the ones who visited Friday and Saturday (to introduce a friend), I think you all did a great job with demos and kept the enthusiasm high! It was nice to get some inside views on how specific heroes can work together from Christopher as well, thanks for being so pumped about the game!</p>",
