      {
        "id": 32456,
        "name": "Rabit",
        "username": "Rabit",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2012-06-04T19:20:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;Tamar&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"Tamar\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>[quote=“Rabit”]For those interested, the author was <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Patrick_Rothfuss\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Patrick Rothfuss</a> (of <span class=\"bbcode-i\"><a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Kingkiller_Chronicle\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Kingkiller Chronicle</a></span> fame. Christopher was really stoked to talk to him, as he’s a fan. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>And how!  I’m surprised he didn’t melt into a little puddle of fan squee <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=12\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> (Like I pretty much did when I got to talk to Gail Simone once OMGOMGOMG)[/quote]</p>\n<p>Oh, the look on Christopher’s face when he pointed Patrick out to me the second time he wandered by was absolutely adorable…  He didn’t quite melt, but it was pretty close. ;D</p>",
        "post_number": 25,
        "post_type": 1,
