        "created_at": "2012-06-04T21:10:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Alas, I can usually only make one Con each year, and that’s usually BGG Con.  That plus an annual deer hunting trip and a quasi-annual family vacation usually eat most of my vacation time.  Combine that with living smack-dab in the middle of Texas means that any of the majors (Pax Prime, Pax East, Gen Con) are air-fare required.</p>",
