        "created_at": "2012-06-04T21:12:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;broccoli&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"broccoli\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Alas, I can usually only make one Con each year, and that’s usually BGG Con.  That plus an annual deer hunting trip and a quasi-annual family vacation usually eat most of my vacation time.  Combine that with living smack-dab in the middle of Texas means that any of the majors (Pax Prime, Pax East, Gen Con) are air-fare required.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>What’s BGG Con? Ever considerd going to Owlcon in Houston?</p>",
